{
  "dom_id": "step-t8208",
  "name": "Finding the Equation of a Proportional Relationship",
  "problem": "When the variables $x$ and $y$ form a proportional relationship, the ratio of any $(x,y)$ pair is constant:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac y x = k\n$$\n\nUsing the relationship between multiplication and division, we can rewrite this equation above as follows:\n\n$$\ny = kx\n$$",
